# Durations of more units than machine integers hold

The components of a duration are machine integers: multiplying a duration by
an integer beyond them is a runtime error, not a wrapped or truncated result.

```catala
declaration scope Overflow:
  input n content integer
  output d content duration

scope Overflow:
  definition d equals 2 day * n
```

```catala-test-cli
$ catala test-scope Overflow --input {"n":"4611686018427387903"}
┌─[ERROR]─
│
│  During evaluation: an integer is too large for this computation.
│
├─➤ tests/date/bad/duration_overflow.catala_en:12.29-30:
│    │
│ 12 │   definition d equals 2 day * n
│    │                             ‾
└─ Durations of more units than machine integers hold
#return code 123#
```

```catala-test-cli
$ catala test-scope Overflow --input {"n":"-100000000000000000000000000000"}
┌─[ERROR]─
│
│  During evaluation: an integer is too large for this computation.
│
├─➤ tests/date/bad/duration_overflow.catala_en:12.29-30:
│    │
│ 12 │   definition d equals 2 day * n
│    │                             ‾
└─ Durations of more units than machine integers hold
#return code 123#
```

```catala-test-cli
$ catala test-scope Overflow --input {"n":"1000"} -F json
{"d":{"years":0,"months":0,"days":2000}}
```

Sums, differences and negations of durations are checked the same way:

```catala
declaration scope Arithmetic:
  input op content integer
  output d content duration

scope Arithmetic:
  definition d equals
    let max equals 4611686018427387903 day in
    if op = 1 then max + 1 day
    else if op = 2 then (0 day - max) - 2 day
    else - ((0 day - max) - 1 day)
```

```catala-test-cli
$ catala test-scope Arithmetic --input {"op":1}
┌─[ERROR]─
│
│  During evaluation: an integer is too large for this computation.
│
├─➤ tests/date/bad/duration_overflow.catala_en:58.24-25:
│    │
│ 58 │     if op = 1 then max + 1 day
│    │                        ‾
└─ Durations of more units than machine integers hold
#return code 123#
```

```catala-test-cli
$ catala test-scope Arithmetic --input {"op":2}
┌─[ERROR]─
│
│  During evaluation: an integer is too large for this computation.
│
├─➤ tests/date/bad/duration_overflow.catala_en:59.39-40:
│    │
│ 59 │     else if op = 2 then (0 day - max) - 2 day
│    │                                       ‾
└─ Durations of more units than machine integers hold
#return code 123#
```

```catala-test-cli
$ catala test-scope Arithmetic --input {"op":3}
┌─[ERROR]─
│
│  During evaluation: an integer is too large for this computation.
│
├─➤ tests/date/bad/duration_overflow.catala_en:60.10-11:
│    │
│ 60 │     else - ((0 day - max) - 1 day)
│    │          ‾
└─ Durations of more units than machine integers hold
#return code 123#
```

A date whose year does not fit a machine integer:

```catala
declaration scope FarDate:
  input years content integer
  output d content date

scope FarDate:
  definition d equals |2000-01-01| + 1 year * years
```

```catala-test-cli
$ catala test-scope FarDate --input {"years":"4611686018427387000"}
┌─[ERROR]─
│
│  During evaluation: an integer is too large for this computation.
│
├─➤ tests/date/bad/duration_overflow.catala_en:113.36-37:
│     │
│ 113 │   definition d equals |2000-01-01| + 1 year * years
│     │                                    ‾
└─ Durations of more units than machine integers hold
#return code 123#
```
